                "description": "Sonoma Collection Large Plate Fusion R2 - Fusion Hardware's Sonoma Large Plate a simple design that is only made better by the additon of one of Fusion's Sonoma Collection Knobs or levers. It is made out of solid brass and is available in either a medium bronze or oil rubbed bronze finish.",
